// IntroString :
"P872448378" "Wrap your presents and count your angels, {HeroName}. Looker-finders have rolled the dice and come up overtime on this one! Clockwork, to be specific. Seems ol' Hami-dam-a-ding-dong didn't put the lights out in every little shop of horrors here in the stewpot. Found ourselves a tick-tock factory, and what's more, it's still got the juice!"
// AcceptString :
"P2345700781" "You found an operational Clockwork manufacturing facility?"
// SendOffString :
"P3899624872" "Sure did. I want you to be slammer number one and go punch card your way through there, take care of any clockies that go cuckoo. Don't worry about the smashin', Splice can put 'em on the mend, you know what I'm jawin'?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2958025230" "Clear out Clockwork in the manufacturing facility"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1255909391" "The sooner we get clocks, the faster we can buff out the battle damage and turn 'em into walking tick-tocks. See what I'm jawin'?"
// TaskTitle :
"P336351569" "<font face=title><color orange>CLOCKWORK STILL WORK</color></font>"
